<p>In the latest development, Lebanon&#x27;s President Joseph Aoun said the 10-day ceasefire that took effect on April 17 should open the way to &quot;permanent agreements.&quot; He called it a &quot;new phase&quot; for Lebanon while insisting that any future deal would not give up territory or national rights. The truce was brokered by the United States, and President Trump said Washington had barred further Israeli bombing in Lebanon as the pause began. The ceasefire has opened a hopeful but fragile window. Thousands of displaced Lebanese started heading back to southern towns and Beirut&#x27;s suburbs, though many found homes and infrastructure badly damaged. At the same time, the arrangement is under immediate strain: Lebanese military officials reported Israeli attacks and shelling after the truce began, Israel told residents in southern Lebanon to stay north of the Litani River, and Israeli officials said their forces would hold positions in the south while keeping their goal of disarming Hezbollah.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/_bLz8PqSQPLj8vA616ObdbrgIpBepEPhJ0kR0Qhfeph_WtICJuW0dTKV5HCkHl6pNfHcnkOHnvl5JA0gS5mQQ9BoT3gTOQTLBls8F11TwGi3OXYmTaPbm_Fr2GWcsG7evCEqDWFdSB5PRXez8Lny8DQkSsbPGUmfIt4c_CT_yioz8CeUptk3e--hiYkHMgXoYYBjhOdAxcfzECy1rMFSTWuSPTV4uiRX' alt='A family returning to Dahiya, Lebanon, after the cease-fire on Friday.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Direct talks: The ceasefire text envisions direct Israel-Lebanon negotiations aimed at producing a &quot;peace between the two countries,&quot; which Al Jazeera described as the first direct talks in decades.</li><li>Israeli politics: Beyond security complaints from northern residents, opposition figures seized on Trump&#x27;s public intervention to argue Netanyahu had lost control of the process, turning the truce into an election-season issue inside Israel.</li><li>Hezbollah stance: Hezbollah boycotted the truce talks, but its politicians later signaled a &quot;cautious commitment&quot; to the 10-day ceasefire while continuing to demand an Israeli withdrawal from southern Lebanon.</li><li>Regional diplomacy: Trump said any U.S. deal with Iran was &quot;in no way subject to Lebanon,&quot; but reports still suggested the truce could remove one obstacle in broader U.S.-Iran diplomacy.</li></ul><blockquote>An arena for anyone&#x27;s wars - President Joseph Aoun</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Lebanese government: Aoun did not spell out whether his call for &quot;permanent agreements&quot; meant a formal peace deal with Israel, highlighting the political ambiguity around what the ceasefire could lead to. (<a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/04/lebanon-president-says-future-deal-will-not-cede-territory'>Al-Monitor</a>)</li><li>Israeli defense establishment: Israeli officials treated the truce as conditional rather than a full stand-down, with reporting that it halts offensive operations while preserving Israel&#x27;s claimed right to act against planned, imminent, or ongoing attacks. (<a href='https://www.rt.com/news/638618-trump-stunned-netanyahu-lebanon/'>RT</a>)</li><li>Displaced Lebanese civilians: Many returnees set out immediately and packed the roads south, saying the chance to sleep at home again was worth the uncertainty of what they would find. (<a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/04/17/world/middleeast/lebanon-cease-fire-traffic-south.html'>The New York Times</a>)</li><li>Northern Israeli residents and opposition: Inside Israel, critics said the way the ceasefire was imposed showed that key decisions had slipped out of Jerusalem&#x27;s hands and into Washington&#x27;s. (<a href='https://www.csmonitor.com/World/Middle-East/2026/0417/israel-trump-lebanon-ceasefire-hezbollah-iran'>The Christian Science Monitor</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/middle-east/lebanon-president-says-ceasefire-should-move-to-permanent-agreements'>Lebanon president says ceasefire should move to permanent agreements</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.rt.com/news/638618-trump-stunned-netanyahu-lebanon/'>Netanyahu ‘alarmed’ by Trump’s Lebanon move – Axios</a> - rt.com</li><li><a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/04/lebanon-president-says-working-permanent-agreements-after-israel-truce'>Lebanon president says working on &#x27;permanent agreements&#x27; after Israel truce</a> - al-monitor.com</li><li><a href='https://www.csmonitor.com/World/Middle-East/2026/0417/israel-trump-lebanon-ceasefire-hezbollah-iran'>Trump announces Lebanon ceasefire, and Israelis vent anger at government</a> - csmonitor.com</li><li><a href='https://www.youtube.com/watch'>Tale of two truces: Lebanon &#x27;steps up&#x27; alongside Israel as Tehran and Washington edge toward a deal</a> - youtube.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/apr/17/donald-trump-iran-war-lebanon-ceasefire'>Donald Trump claims to have ended a 10th war – but will the Lebanon ceasefire hold?</a> - theguardian.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/truce-in-effect-as-trump-says-israel-prohibited-from-bombing-lebanon/article70875143.ece'>Truce in effect as Trump says Israel ‘prohibited’ from bombing Lebanon</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/4/17/lebanon-president-says-country-is-no-longer-a-pawn-amid-israel-ceasefire'>Lebanon president says country is no longer a pawn amid Israel ceasefire</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/04/17/world/middleeast/lebanon-israel-ceasefire-hezbollah.html'>Lebanon’s Cease-Fire Buys Time, Not a Way Out</a> - nytimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/israel-iran-war-enough-is-enough-trump-says-us-banned-israel-from-bombing-lebanon-11372883#publisher=newsstand'>&quot;Enough Is Enough&quot;: Trump Says US Banned Israel From Bombing Lebanon</a> - ndtv.com</li><li><a href='https://www.spiked-online.com/2026/04/18/israel-is-not-at-war-with-lebanon/'>Israel is not at war with Lebanon</a> - spiked-online.com</li><li><a href='https://www.lemonde.fr/en/international/article/2026/04/18/in-israel-opposition-criticizes-ceasefire-with-lebanon-imposed-by-donald-trump-on-benjamin-netanyahu_6752557_4.html'>In Israel, the opposition criticizes ceasefire with Lebanon imposed by Trump on Netanyahu</a> - lemonde.fr</li><li><a href='http://www.euronews.com/2026/04/18/lebanon-president-says-his-country-is-in-a-new-phase-after-israel-truce'>Lebanon president says his country is in &#x27;a new phase&#x27; after Israel truce</a> - euronews.com</li><li><a href='https://aje.news/zo0udq?update=4500249'>The Lebanese military says that there have been several Israeli attacks and artillery shelling incidents in violation of the ceasefire.</a> - aje.news</li></ul>